<title>USA: American Airlines jet makes emergency landing in NY.</title>
<headline>American Airlines jet makes emergency landing in NY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>An American Airlines MD-80 made an emergency landing with nose gear problems at JFK International Airport Monday night, a police spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>She said the plane flying from Chicago to New York's La Guardia with 93 passengers and crew on board landed safely and only two minor injuries were reported. The airport was closed after the plane landed, she said.</p>
